
### Register new equipment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Water Pump",
  "category": "Mechanical",
  "serialNumber": "WP001",
  "manufacturer": "Grundfos",
  "location": "Kigali",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### Get all equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/equipment
### Get equipment by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/equipment/1
### Register maintenance
POST http://localhost:8080/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipment": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "maintenanceType": "Preventive Maintenance",
  "description": "Routine inspection and servicing of water pump",
  "maintenanceDate": "2026-11-12",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "technicianName": "John",
  "cost": 50000
}
### Get all registered equipment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/equipment

